{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 41, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "泉州 今泉州濱海, 極望海中, 諸夷國可見焉.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 296, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "初渡遼而敗, 再行次遼水征之, 而楊玄感反, 又將征之, 而天下亂.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 6, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "晉 張華曰:「朝鮮有泉水, 洌水, 汕水三水, 合爲洌水, 疑樂浪·朝鮮取名於此也.」汕, 所晏切.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 53, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "見尙書大傳.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 219, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "地名. 在浿水東.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 128, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "並今東夷之地,", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0050_0030", "id": null, "offset": 151, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "原本云: 牲口牛馬, 據通攷刪正.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 89, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今營·平二州之間也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 224, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "夏言並王也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 231, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "夏言妃也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 486, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "音俠", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 771, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "原本, 訛連據, 通攷改正.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 665, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "漢 遼東郡 西安平縣北, 有小水, 南流入海. 勾驪別種, 依小水作居, 因名之爲小水貊也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1153, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "遼東屬邑.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1663, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "卽漢 樂浪郡, 王儉自慕容慕來伐後, 徙國內城, 移都此城.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3106, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "其主元, 在位十八年死, 高武卽元異母弟.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3121, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "此官總選兵, 猶吏部·兵部尙書也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3137, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "蘇文鬚面甚偉, 形體魁傑, 衣服冠履, 皆飾以金彩, 身佩五刀, 常挑臂高步, 意氣豪逸, 左右莫敢仰視, 恒令武官, 貴人俯伏於地, 登背上下馬.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0100_0010", "id": null, "offset": 716, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "原本訛, 詩據舊唐書改正", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0110_0010", "id": null, "offset": 599, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "或名邪摩", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0110_0010", "id": null, "offset": 765, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "一作伊", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0110_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1184, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "音撰緣也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_042_ko_042_0110_0010", "id": null, "offset": 2031, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "唐會要, 作調提志.", "type": "원주"}
